    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d535-a1">

                <pb facs="0614" n="1292" sameAs="frus:frus1863p2/pg1292"/>

                <head>[Telegram.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-10-05"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >October</hi> 5, 1862, 2 <hi rendition="#italic">o’clock</hi>, 10
                                <hi rendition="#italic">minutes p.
                    m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Steamer Bahama, with men and munitions, is going to meet Semmes at Western
                    islands. Turkish steamer Shasgehaad has taken despatches there for Semmes.
                    Cruise there for some days with Kearsarge.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MORAN, <hi rendition="#italic">London.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Captain <hi rendition="#small-caps">Craven</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Steamer Tuscarora.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
